.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#subject/National%20Archives"}], "owl:sameAs": "NARA 111-ADC-8634", "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://iiif.archive.org/iiif/3/111-adc-8634/manifest.json", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "기관 매니페스트"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "KOREAN WAR, UIJONGBU ; REFUGEES, PUSAN, KOREA ; EVACUATION, HUNGNAM AREA, KOREA, BOKU-DO Produced: January 2, 1951 https://catalog.archives.gov/id/22399", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-23T03:01:45Z", "prov:used": ["ia"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-23T03:15:42Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"]}}, {"@id": "https://archive.org/details/QF4OCzIor4S5rHJoO2i4eNOiB5MkE2", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "\"THAT WAR IN KOREA \" KOREAN WAR DOCUMENTARY 1950 INVASION TO HUNGNAM EVACUATION PART 1 6344", "rico:identifier": "QF4OCzIor4S5rHJoO2i4eNOiB5MkE2", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:ia:IA Collection › PeriscopeFilm"}, "rico:hasOrHadSubject": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#medium/movies"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#subject/Busan%20Port"}], "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://iiif.archive.org/iiif/3/QF4OCzIor4S5rHJoO2i4eNOiB5MkE2/manifest.json", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "기관 매니페스트"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "Encyclopedia Britannica (:41) presents \"That War in Korea\", a documentary about the Korean War of 1950 to 1953. Originally produced as a Project XX documentary. The film opens with USS Pickaway (:55). Pickaway shuttled US troops from Japan to Pusan. US soldiers bid wives and families goodbye at the start of the war (1:02). Wounded are drug across land (1:47). A funeral service follows (1:57). Rich", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-23T03: